{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"では"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.なんか動物飼ってますか？\nＡ.勝ってないよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sweat01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動物の癒しが欲しいです(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．ずっとあみちゃんのことが気になってます！もう推してもいいかな？\nＡ.じゃああみ単押しね?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決まり～っ(^◇^)┛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．あみちゃんの中で、今、はまってるものは何？\n最近はまっていることは何ですか？\nＡ.お顔コロコロする事"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"痩せろ痩せろ～って念をこめてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．あみちゃんはアニーのトゥモロー歌えますか？\nＡ.もちろん歌えます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/scissors.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、歌います？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/smile.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．あみあみがこの写メで携帯につけてるマスコットの名前を教えて欲しいです☆\nＡ.あみももらい物だからよくわからんのだけど、「LUCKY PINZA」ってやつ!あとこびとづかんのカクレモモジリ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/smile.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．男の浮気許せるの‥どこまで～？\nＡ.ん～、あんまり他の女の子と２人でしゃべったりはして欲しくないかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑\nエヘ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．それと自分のここが好きって所教えてください。他のメンバーのここ大好きって所教えてください\nＡ.あみあんまり自分の事好きくないんだあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sweat02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しいてゆうなら目かな?\nメンバーはね、皆ノリがめっちゃ良い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それに優しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな私を受け止めてくれる優しいメンバーが大好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．AKBの曲で一番好きな曲は？\nＡ.Everydayカチューシャとか可愛くて好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/flair.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．好きなスポーツはなんですか？\nＡ.バドミントンとか楽しいよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/confident.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バスケもへったくそだけど好きよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/scissors.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","t